Package: dunst
Version: @DEB_DUNST_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: X11/Wayland Apps
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://dunst-project.org/
Depends: dbus, libwayland0, libcairo2, libpango-1.0-0, libpangocairo-1.0-0, libglib2.0-0, libgdk-pixbuf-2.0-0, libharfbuzz0b, libintl8
Description: Lightweight notification daemon (Wayland)
 dunst implements org.freedesktop.Notifications and renders notifications with
 pangocairo into wl_shm buffers mapped as a zwlr_layer_surface_v1 overlay. It
 speaks D-Bus via GDBus (gio/GLib) rather than sd-bus, so unlike mako it needs
 no libsystemd/basu — only a running session bus (dbus). Built Wayland-only (the
 X11 backend is disabled). Runs as a native Wayland client under the iosc
 compositor, which must serve wlr-layer-shell (top/overlay) and xdg-shell.
